Warning [L0201]: implicit clone of `p`; write `^p` to transfer ownership or `.clone()` to silence this warning
  --> tests/ui_lint/struct_implicit_clone.jet:10:10
    |
 10 |     show(p)
    |          ^
 Why: `show` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: write `^p` to move, or `p.clone()` to copy explicitly
